# Versification "BSB": the stored Berean Standard Bible (`bsb`) against eng.vrs.
# Bible-API correction file, checked 2026-11-02 against cep_public
# translation 16 (chapter lengths and verse texts). A book line replaces the
# book's chapter lengths; a mapping replaces the base mapping of its verse.
#
# BSB 3 John 1:14 and Revelation 12:17 include the following verse of eng.vrs;
# 2 Corinthians 13:12-13 is the original 13:12 (eng.vrs maps none of 13).
3JN 1:14
REV 1:20 2:29 3:22 4:11 5:14 6:17 7:17 8:13 9:21 10:11 11:19 12:17 13:18 14:20 15:8 16:21 17:18 18:24 19:21 20:15 21:27 22:21
3JN 1:14 = 3JN 1:14-15
REV 12:17 = REV 12:17-18
2CO 13:12-13 = 2CO 13:12
2CO 13:14 = 2CO 13:13
# Mappings eng.vrs lacks, without which these verses would map back onto
# their neighbour: Numbers 26:1 also holds the original 25:19; Nehemiah
# 7:68, Isaiah 64:1 and Acts 19:41 share an original verse with the
# preceding one.
NUM 26:1 = NUM 25:19
NUM 26:1 = NUM 26:1
NEH 7:67 = NEH 7:67
NEH 7:68 = NEH 7:67
ISA 63:19 = ISA 63:19
ISA 64:1 = ISA 63:19
ACT 19:40 = ACT 19:40
ACT 19:41 = ACT 19:40
